{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#853","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#853","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#853\",\"parent_revision\":\"8d84afd2df95621bad28e267aa276857faa092bb734b6e68e01876c2692af83b\",\"root_revision\":\"8d84afd2df95621bad28e267aa276857faa092bb734b6e68e01876c2692af83b\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe org secret `RELEASE_TOKEN` was last updated 2022-08-11 and the PAT inside it is almost certainly revoked, causing `ncipollo/release-action` to fail with \\\"Parameter token or opts.auth is required\\\". The release job must either have the PAT rotated and the secret updated, or the design decision must be made explicitly to replace it with `GITHUB_TOKEN` (which has `contents: write`) and documented as such \u2014 not a silent fallback.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **fix expired release_token for ci release job** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: PRD-vm-flightsimulator-v2\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"901f2cda79ff3427ac15361fc5fc06019a66e3401de3066596094b469d3430bd\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVDDPzw\"}"}